{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32024","headline":"逢博陵故人彭兵曹 · 贾岛","name":"逢博陵故人彭兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲阳分散会京华，见说三年住海涯。\n别後解餐蓬虆子，向前未识牡丹花。\n偶逢日者敎求禄，终傍泉声拟置家。\n蹋雪携琴相就宿，夜深开户斗牛斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}